ve ResizeObserver(update) and disconnect cleanup. No production default-constructor bug in reviewed path.'\n elif 'vite@5.4.0' in ''.join(c['body'] for c in t['comments']):evidence='DevFn current declared ^6.4.3 and exact own nested lock Vite6.4.3. No blanket root Vite/security clearance; physical candidate closure still required.'\n elif 'svelte@5.0.0' in ''.join(c['body'] for c in t['comments']):evidence='DevFn current declared ^5.55.7 and exact own nested Svelte5.55.7, above cited patches. No global security clearance.'\n elif p.endswith('lifecycle.md'):evidence='Current complete lifecycle paragraph explicitly separates .devfn runtime/output paths and XDG_STATE_HOME/devfn fallback ~/.local/state/devfn; actual defaultStateDir frozen trust.ts matches.'\n elif 'Search' in p or p.endswith('Search.svelte'):evidence='Current shared Search actual fetch /docs/search.json, DevFn delegates @site/docs-search and actual docs/search.json route exists. Native deployed/live proof remains separate.'\n elif p.startswith('.github/') or i.endswith('mP2wk') or i.endswith('nFrGA'):evidence='Current config registers DevFn dev/live hosts, selector checks devfn/docs, deploy workflow paths/product/tag choices and route-sync product/zone env exist. This is local declaration truth; no hosted URL/token/domain proof.'\n elif p.endswith('app.html'):evidence='Frozen template has no static title; LandingPage and docs route own dynamic titles. Prior duplicate-title repair retained; Sonar template add-title advice invalid. Error-title ownership assessed separately.'\n elif p.endswith('getting-started.md'):evidence='Current commands preview init, explicit init --yes then doctor --trust; current CLI returns writtenfalse without --yes. No OS lifecycle execution claimed.'\n elif 'migration.md' in p:evidence='Current reference checklist explicitly warns worktree Compose project changes named-volume identity, backs up container-only data before first start and preserves preexisting generated-output tar