 own existing context/lock, with scripts enabled, SSD-routed cache/temp/gyp/XDG/UUID/writability/same-filesystem/fresh reserve. No root or sibling lock copied. Revalidate actual owners/closures/public exports and run actual independent tests/types/build/dev/HTTP/LLM cases in all3 contexts. Never count historical210 pass as current212 acceptance. Current source/archives/install/root native receipts remain distinct; publication/promotion and hosted/live gates remain closed. No unrelated worktree, .conduct/.entire/traineddata, infrastructure/registry/reviewer changes.\n"}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-6.1-sol","usage":{"input":2890,"output":1691,"cacheRead":237952,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":1277,"totalTokens":242533,"cost":{"input":0.0057799999999999995,"output":0.01691,"cacheRead":0.023795200000000002,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.046485200000000004}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1791223610917,"responseId":"resp_055fb762f51dfcfc016ac3e73b89dc87d0904625a8ea588643","rawStopReason":"completed","thinkingLevel":"high"}}
